Startled: (An American Horror Tale by [http://www.dylanleann.com%20 Dylan Leann]) Fear was something that Morgan never knew until she bought her small cottage style condo in Seabreak. The small turn of the century home was built in 1901 and had a gorgeous beach front view with an enchanting stone and plank boardwalk only five minutes to the sea. All was perfect in her life, a new job the perfect home when unexpectedly her world takes a terrifying turn. Come away with me to Seabreak - you'll never be the same.